    820  2647							; Enemies: half of them each frame (even slots on even frames, odd slots on
    821  2647							; odd frames), so each moves in steps of two frames. Each walks left at its
    822  2647							; kind's pace; a toy in its way stops it and gets chewed, except: the
    823  2647							; helicopter hops over the first toy, the pogo frog jumps to the next shelf
    824  2647							; once, the balloon clown floats over every toy, the T-Rex crushes a toy in
    825  2647							; one bite. A lasso holds it; reaching the toy box is a breach.
