   1540  2b1b							; the theme (original): melody in eighths, 1-6 = C5 D5 E5 G5 A5 C6, 7 = tie,
   1541  2b1b							; 0 = rest; bass in quarters, 1-5 = F3 G3 A3 C4 E3
